✔ a derived value that is invalid only in a combination of controls is refused before any verifier call (261.3133ms)
✔ every position of a slider is checked, the interior ones included (368.0677ms)
✔ a scene with more settings than are checked, or a control whose settings cannot all be listed, is refused: never sampled (117.9924ms)
✔ the verifier reads exactly the settings the gates check (42.3561ms)
✔ scene schema permits deterministic geometry and rejects scripts, cycles, invalid animation and limits (7.5491ms)
